        </div>

        <!-- Candidate Signature Card -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50/80 dark:bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-7 shadow-2xs flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-950 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
                  2
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Candidate Signature</h3>
              </div>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 dark:bg-blue-950 dark:text-blue-300 border border-blue-200/60 dark:border-blue-800">
                10 KB – 20 KB
              </span>
            </div>

            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
              Scanned signature used for biometric verification and exam attendance sheets.
            </p>

            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 font-medium">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span><strong>Dimensions:</strong> 4.0 cm (width) × 2.0 cm (height)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span><strong>Pixel Requirement:</strong> Exactly 140 pixels width × 60 pixels height</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span><strong>File Size Ceiling:</strong> Strictly between 10.0 KB and 20.0 KB</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span><strong>Paper &amp; Ink:</strong> Black or dark blue ink on clean unruled white sheet</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span><strong>Contrast:</strong> High contrast, normalized paper background</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 mt-0.5" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.707 7.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414L8.586 10l-1.293 1.293a1 1 0 101.414 1.414L10 11.414l1.293 1.293a1 1 0 001.414-1.414L11.414 10l1.293-1.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L10 8.586 8.707 7.293z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span><strong>Strictly Prohibited:</strong> Capital letters for entire signature, blurred scans</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How it Works Step by Step Guide -->
    <section class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800" aria-labelledby="guide-heading">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">Step-By-Step Workflow</span>
        <h2 id="guide-heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1.5 mb-3 tracking-tight">
          How to Resize Photo &amp; Signature for SSC CHSL Online
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          Resize your documents in four simple steps without installing apps or uploading files to remote servers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-start shadow-2xs">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            01
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1.5">Select Document Mode</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Click <strong>Passport Photo</strong> (50 KB ceiling) or <strong>Signature</strong> (20 KB ceiling). The preset parameters lock automatically.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-start shadow-2xs">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            02
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1.5">Upload Your Image</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Drag and drop or browse any JPEG, PNG, or WebP photo up to 25 MB directly from your mobile phone or PC.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-start shadow-2xs">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            03
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1.5">Instant Local Math</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            In-memory Canvas downscales to 300 DPI, runs binary search quality optimization, and strips EXIF headers in &lt; 200 ms.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-2xl flex flex-col items-start shadow-2xs">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            04
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1.5">Download Portal JPG</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
            Click download to receive your pre-named compliant JPG ready for instant submission on the official SSC application portal.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why SSC Portal Rejects Uploads Section -->
    <section class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800" aria-labelledby="reasons-heading">
      <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400">Technical Explanations</span>
          <h2 id="reasons-heading" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1.5 mb-4 tracking-tight">
            Why SSC Portal Rejects Images (And How SetImgKB Fixes It)
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Every year, thousands of SSC CHSL and CGL candidates face application disqualification due to portal validation errors. Here is the technical breakdown of why traditional resizing tools fail:
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <!-- Trap 1 -->
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-950/80 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-xs mt-0.5">
                !
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">
                  1. Smartphone EXIF &amp; Metadata Bloat
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                  Modern iPhone and Android smartphones embed 15 KB to 50 KB of non-image metadata inside image headers (GPS coordinates, device model, lens aperture, and thumbnail previews). Standard online tools only compress pixel data without stripping headers, causing the final file size to violate byte boundaries or crash the SSC verification parser. <strong>SetImgKB renders directly to an HTML5 canvas, reconstructing the image from raw raster pixels and stripping 100% of metadata.</strong>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Trap 2 -->
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-950/80 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-xs mt-0.5">
                !
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">
                  2. Non-Deterministic Quality Sliders
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                  Tools that give you a "Quality: 80%" slider rely on guesswork. High-detail photos might end up at 52 KB (exceeding the 50 KB ceiling), while low-detail photos shrink to 18 KB (failing the 20 KB floor). <strong>SetImgKB uses an iterative binary search engine that converges exactly within a strict 95%–98% corridor below your target ceiling.</strong>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Trap 3 -->
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-950/80 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 font-bold text-xs mt-0.5">
                !
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-1">
                  3. Aspect Ratio Distortion on Admit Cards
                </h3>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                  Arbitrarily forcing an image into dimensions without locked proportional scaling stretches facial features vertically or squashes them horizontally. When printed on SSC examination admit cards, distorted photos fail visual facial matching at exam centres. <strong>SetImgKB locks the official 3.5 × 4.5 cm aspect ratio with iterative 2× downsampling to preserve crisp biometric edges.</strong>
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Trap 4 -->
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
